OL,3,GNEWSACelebrity Traitors: Can I visit
OL,4,Athe castle, ride the train and see the
OL,5,Aunusual monument?
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Celebrity Traitors is back with a
OL,8,Fnew cast of stars vying to be the
OL,9,Fwinner (or winners) of the TV mega-hit.
OL,11,FHosted by Claudia Winkleman, the show
OL,12,Fwill see a group of famous 'faithfuls'
OL,13,Fattempt to work out which among them
OL,14,Fare the 'traitors' secretly "murdering"
OL,15,Fcontestants each night.
OL,17,FThis year's line-up features
OL,18,Faward-winning actor and campaigner
OL,19,FMichael Sheen, comedian Miranda Hart,
OL,20,FEastEnders hardman Ross Kemp and Love
OL,21,FIsland presenter Maya Jama.
OL,23,APub: 24-JanQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
